# Testing

- Test behavior and policy, not private function names.
- No `pytest.skip` / `pytest.xfail` to green CI.
- Every mutating endpoint needs at least one negative authz test.
- No real LLM network in unit tests; heuristic path is the CI default.
- Flaky tests fail the build.
- Do not rewrite assertions to match buggy code; fix the code or the spec.
